# Complete, current-run alternatives. They are comparison documents, not selected/adopted render inputs.
a1=base.replace('Her concentrated face carries an intimate, vulnerable presence within the emergency; a small sheen of perspiration catches the work light.','Clear tear fluid pools along both lower eyelid margins while her upper and lower lips press together in one closed seam. Her concentrated face carries an intimate, vulnerable presence within the emergency; a small sheen of perspiration catches the work light.').replace('She watches the remaining gap as she works, lips slightly parted,','She watches the remaining gap as she works, her lips still closed,')
